### Muonic X-rays in a CZT plane right under the 4 cm Al target, one job (scripts/muonic_xray_czt.sh runs many): the
### setup of macro/muonic_xray_target.mac with the Si/YSO stack taken out (/tof/det/stack false) and, in its place,
### the CZT plane of compton_satellite_sim/compton_camera_DSSD (/tof/czt/...: 4 x 4 pixels of 25 x 25 x 10 mm,
### Cd0.9Zn0.1Te at 5.78 g/cm3), its top face against the target's bottom face. Cosmic mu+ and mu- of czEmin - czEmax
### GeV, from the plane of the stack runs; only events with energy in the CZT are written (/EventFilter 7, columns
### czt_*, with the mux_* truth of the capture photons). The live time in the run tree is that of the band. Needs the
### aliases czSeed, czEvents, czDir, czFile, czEmin, czEmax, tgtCm, tgtZ and cztZ (centres in cm).

/tof/det/worldSize 420 420 300 cm
/tof/det/stack false
/tof/target/size 20 20 {tgtCm} cm
/tof/target/position 0 0 {tgtZ} cm
/tof/czt/enable true
/tof/czt/position 0 0 {cztZ} cm
/update

/OutputFormat 1
/EventFilter 7
/OutputDirectory {czDir}
/OutputFile {czFile}
/gun/seed {czSeed}
/GeneralParticleSource 2
/tof/cosmic/model expacs
/tof/cosmic/species mu+ mu-
/tof/cosmic/angular all 2 mu+ guan mu- guan
/tof/cosmic/planeCenter 0 0 112 cm
/tof/cosmic/halfX 200 cm
/tof/cosmic/halfY 200 cm
/tof/cosmic/thetaMax 75 deg
/tof/cosmic/energyMin {czEmin} GeV
/tof/cosmic/energyMax {czEmax} GeV
/run/beamOn {czEvents}
